  "goodToKnow": "Die Vermeidung is avoidance or prevention, and it's common in official language: zur Vermeidung von Fehlern, die Steuervermeidung (tax avoidance), Müllvermeidung (waste prevention). The verb is vermeiden (vermied, vermieden): Fehler vermeiden. Unvermeidlich or unvermeidbar means inevitable. In Germany's waste hierarchy, Vermeidung comes first, before recycling. It has no plural."
